There are pairwise disjoint open balls $U_0,U_k^+,U_k^-$ centered at $0,a_k,-a_k$, respectively, and a bounded continuous function $u:U\to\mathbb R$, where $$U=U_0\cup U_1^+\cup U_1^-\cup U_2^+\cup U_2^-,$$ such that $$\label{eq:certificate}
